WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 010. THE IDEA SOUNDS CLEAR. Until nouns mean different things.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
ENTITIES. GIVE THINGS STABLE IDENTITIES. Place is not Project.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
FIELDS. TYPE. REQUIRED. CONSTRAINT. Every field earns meaning and rules.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
GRAPH. FROM → RELATIONSHIP → TO. Cardinality makes connections testable.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
FACTS. AUTHORITY. LOCATOR. FRESHNESS. Build source rules into structure.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
BOUNDARY. STRUCTURE IS NOT TRUTH. It makes assumptions testable.
